  "modifications": "The edition's text-critical signs are removed from the word forms. Each word is aligned to the reading the SBL text follows in STEPBible's Translators Amalgamated Greek NT, which supplies its Strong's numbers, grammar, dictionary form and gloss, and is placed on that reading's KJV verse. Accents are stored in composed Unicode form. Verses in KJV numbering that the SBL text lacks show the words of other editions with a note, and verses where the Textus Receptus differs carry a note. Every change to STEPBible data is listed in resources/stepbible-tagnt/CHANGES.md.",
